# RuiJing Vietnam factory — source-only repository
#
# Tracks source. Build artifacts, dependency trees, station-machine build
# output and model weights are excluded so `git ls-files --others` stays
# small enough for tools (T3 Code, IDEs) to enumerate.
#
# The failure this fixes:
#   T3 Code hung on every turn ("Working 11m" on "hello"). The server trace
#   showed, repeatedly:
#     GitVcsDriver.review.listUntracked: Git command failed:
#     Git output exceeded 16777216 bytes and was truncated.
#   The untracked file list was 29 MB / 172,618 files. T3 caps git output at
#   16 MB, so every status poll failed and the agent never made progress.
#   After this .gitignore the same list is a fraction of that.
#
# The big offenders, by file count:
#   瑞晶越南工位-正式命名/manualine20260823   41,535  station build output
#   瑞晶越南工位-正式命名/20260819manaline     5,714
#   统一PDA管理/unifiedpda/.gradle-home        (Gradle wrapper dists)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
bower_components/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv-*/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
out/
target/
.next/
.nuxt/
.turbo/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Station / ATE build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tcl timezone+locale data bundled into every station executable.
_tcl_data/
tzdata/
# Station executable + scratch trees produced on the factory floor.
*_dist_*/
*_work_*/
*_exe_dist_*/
*_exe_work_*/
# Packaged installers and their payloads.
*.msg
*.enc
*.msi
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.7z
*.iso
*.img
# ATE runtime scratch.
_internal/_logs/
_internal/logs/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Android / Gradle
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.gradle/
.gradle-home/
**/.gradle/
**/.gradle-home/
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab

